<title>JAPAN: Pioneer Electronic -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Electronic -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		164.17		vs	  176.63</p>
<p> Operating     loss 7.33		vs     loss 7.27</p>
<p> Current	 loss 7.92		vs     loss 7.34</p>
<p> Net	    loss 12.69		vs     loss 8.51</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 70.66 yen	  vs    loss 47.37 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    180 million	  vs	 180 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Pioneer Electronic Corp specialises in audio equipment.</p>
</text>
